# Runtime/report output
reports/**
!reports/slice_monitor
!reports/slice_monitor/README.md
# Publish evidence (Ivan policy 2026-07-05): anything Ivan authorized for upload
# must be committed — *.uploaded.json manifests stay tracked even under reports/.
# 2026-07-10: the whole audit chain is evidence — versioned/superseded copies
# (*.uploaded.v1-BV….json), the frozen upload manifests, the idempotency
# ledger and the batch result records all stay tracked too.
!reports/**/
!reports/**/*.uploaded.json
!reports/**/*.uploaded.*.json
!reports/**/*.public_verify.json
!reports/**/*.public_verify.*.json
!reports/**/*.upload_manifest*.json
!reports/**/upload_ledger.jsonl
!reports/**/ivan_*_results.json
# 2026-07-13: tag edits are publish actions too — suggestion reports, applied
# plans and verified results stay tracked (Ivan review record included).
!reports/tag-suggestions-*/**
!reports/**/tag_plan*.json
!reports/**/tag_update_results*.json
# launchd rsync mirror from free; canonical upload evidence lives elsewhere.
reports/slice_monitor/autoslice_free/**
cleanup_manifests/*.tmp

# Local media/artifact pulls; remote free:/opt/bilive/app and container:/app are source of truth
lidousha/[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]/**
# runner smoke deliveries (pulled back from free by launchd; disposable)
lidousha/smoke*/**
# local safekeeping mirror of the fixed branding intro; the committed authority
# is assets/lidousha/intro/ and the runtime bytes live on free:/opt/bilive/autoslice/assets/intro/
lidousha/branding/**
*.mp4
*.flv
*.m4s
*.part
*.ts
*.mov

# Secrets — never commit. Paid GEMINI_KEY_BACKUP lives in root .env locally;
# runtime authority is the 600-perm env on free. Key values must never enter git.
.env
.env.*

# Local pulls of isolated eval/rerun deliverables from free (disposable mirrors)
lidousha/eval-*/**
lidousha/rerun-*/**

# Agent/session-local state
.hermes/**

# Python/tool caches
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# OS/editor noise
.DS_Store
.cache/timely-term-crawler/
*.swp
*.swo

# Deployment/hotfix backups; keep only if explicitly referenced by a cleanup manifest
*.bak-*
*.backup
